{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ticking Together</strong>, you take on the role of one of four elite bomb defuse team in a stylish cyberpunk world teetering on the edge of annihilation. Somewhere beneath the neon haze and mechanical chaos lies a bomb powerful enough to level the entire city\u2014and you're the unlucky team assigned to deliver it across a series of deadly obstacle courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The catch? Every 15 seconds, the bomb must be stabilized using a unique hand scan. That means moving fast, thinking faster, and tossing the live payload between teammates as you jump, slide, climb, and dash across impossible terrain. Drop it, and you're done. Forget to scan it, and the city burns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/ef555cbaef11ea932df0d4f5d837d841.poster.avif?t=1764773583\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/ef555cbaef11ea932df0d4f5d837d841.webm?t=1764773583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/ef555cbaef11ea932df0d4f5d837d841.mp4?t=1764773583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Ticking Tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A live bomb accompanies you every step of the way. It must be scanned every 15 seconds to stay stable. Coordination is survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>1-4 Player Co-op Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 3 friends. Coordinate your movements, time your bomb passes, and stay in sync, because in Ticking Together, every second counts and every misstep can blow it all up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Stylized Platforming in a Cyberpunk World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, climb, and run through a series of carefully crafted levels set in a visually striking cyberpunk city. Each stage offers new challenges and a distinct atmosphere, combining skill-based platforming with a unique, stylized look.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Physics-Based Bomb Tossing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tossing the bomb between players isn't just a feature, it's a necessity. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill-Based Trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision movement, reaction speed, and tight coordination define success. Every player is responsible for the team\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/0433a26e8907c845dfa8aa86b3ee62fb.poster.avif?t=1764773583\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/0433a26e8907c845dfa8aa86b3ee62fb.webm?t=1764773583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/0433a26e8907c845dfa8aa86b3ee62fb.mp4?t=1764773583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a ticking timer and nowhere to hide, Ticking Together transforms platforming into a coordination under pressure of shared responsibility. Every scan is a second chance. Every pass is a risk. Every run tells a story of mutual excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is ticking. Are you fast enough to beat it together? </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Spark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673320/afa38b64861bb1b0e733642b88ff19debd8791c6.jpg"},{"name":"Checkpoint Champ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673320/423973627e0cdd9296d6edbd955e2e02f526894e.jpg"},{"name":"Signed, Sealed, Delivered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673320/231bdcb5f3a3a183bf86d99735191836355d410c.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Routine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673320/fa24cfeaf3e7e40f60275eccbe4d9dbbc0a95ce6.jpg"},{"name":"Wallrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673320/0b839768061d2e23399cc8ecae3392342de08e88.jpg"},{"name":"Hooked on Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673320/633ed97acbe3ca9c710ea3a06543f5640fa89ede.jpg"},{"name":"Jump Pad Junkie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673320/028ce21ae68958e336d63a1939c979ccfeaf50f1.jpg"},{"name":"On the Buzzer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673320/d7a13617a19f97143fce6178d765d874dd59f7e4.jpg"},{"name":"Metronome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673320/9df4cf0ada404072914d464c9cd7db803ebbad98.jpg"},{"name":"Gravity Loves You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3673320/74cc8400f049774016eb9ba2f7955b4b62d1fda5.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673320?t=1764773583","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/e753a8f6d07620d803227cc0c8ec256a56de8e9c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764773583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/916aeecdb1800f2c6c5a18475ce9b68bc698b843/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764773583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/916aeecdb1800f2c6c5a18475ce9b68bc698b843/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764773583","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4090510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Ticking Together - Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/e3e3ba3a193ee4be63905b7bd6d3fe36.avif?t=1764773583\" width=400 height=1750 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ticking Together</strong>, you take on the role of one of four elite bomb defuse team in a stylish cyberpunk world teetering on the edge of annihilation. Somewhere beneath the neon haze and mechanical chaos lies a bomb powerful enough to level the entire city\u2014and you're the unlucky team assigned to deliver it across a series of deadly obstacle courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The catch? Every 15 seconds, the bomb must be stabilized using a unique hand scan. That means moving fast, thinking faster, and tossing the live payload between teammates as you jump, slide, climb, and dash across impossible terrain. Drop it, and you're done. Forget to scan it, and the city burns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/ef555cbaef11ea932df0d4f5d837d841.poster.avif?t=1764773583\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/ef555cbaef11ea932df0d4f5d837d841.webm?t=1764773583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/ef555cbaef11ea932df0d4f5d837d841.mp4?t=1764773583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Ticking Tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A live bomb accompanies you every step of the way. It must be scanned every 15 seconds to stay stable. Coordination is survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>1-4 Player Co-op Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 3 friends. Coordinate your movements, time your bomb passes, and stay in sync, because in Ticking Together, every second counts and every misstep can blow it all up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Stylized Platforming in a Cyberpunk World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, climb, and run through a series of carefully crafted levels set in a visually striking cyberpunk city. Each stage offers new challenges and a distinct atmosphere, combining skill-based platforming with a unique, stylized look.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Physics-Based Bomb Tossing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tossing the bomb between players isn't just a feature, it's a necessity. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill-Based Trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision movement, reaction speed, and tight coordination define success. Every player is responsible for the team\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/0433a26e8907c845dfa8aa86b3ee62fb.poster.avif?t=1764773583\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/0433a26e8907c845dfa8aa86b3ee62fb.webm?t=1764773583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/extras/0433a26e8907c845dfa8aa86b3ee62fb.mp4?t=1764773583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a ticking timer and nowhere to hide, Ticking Together transforms platforming into a coordination under pressure of shared responsibility. Every scan is a second chance. Every pass is a risk. Every run tells a story of mutual excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is ticking. Are you fast enough to beat it together? </p>","developers":["Furkan Baytak","Furkan \u00d6zkaya"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673320/d5d3921624cf7c00f1db091bbd4b31c29e523b21/header.jpg?t=1764773583","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3673320/1252071999/28dc19931f7e6a4c7d2ab8393e0ca6e3262b8c3b/1764596894/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764600798","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3673320/1252071999/28dc19931f7e6a4c7d2ab8393e0ca6e3262b8c3b/1764596894/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764600798","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3673320/1252071999/28dc19931f7e6a4c7d2ab8393e0ca6e3262b8c3b/1764596894/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764600798","id":257241423,"name":"Ticking Together Official Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257241423/a8477ea00dae744458a5b4249b91d6bbac307530/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764600798"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3673320/1468437212/170db3